WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Luke backs away as Ryu begins the recorded throw attempt.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.800
Standing heavy punch punishes Ryu’s missed throw.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.550
Perfect light Flash Knuckle starts the juggle.

4
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.450
Light Sand Blast catches Ryu at the wall.

5
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.200
Light Rising Uppercut completes the punish.
